            "review_title": "Review at Banh Xeo Ca Mau",
            "review_text": "Stuart B\nAngaston, Australia72 contributions\n0\nGreat cheap eats with local pancake\nMay 2018 • Couples\nStaying close by and thought we would give it a go. Turns out a very good call. Local pan cake was very lovely. Staff were very happy and friendly, not much English spoken for us but no problem - as we were able to navigate the simple and tasty menu through pictures and a few simple local words. Flavoursome, fresh, welcoming local food and very clean. Many locals which is always a good sign. Well worth a look.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 1, 2018",
