            "review_title": "Review at Banh Xeo Ca Mau",
            "review_text": "G C\nAnchorage, Alaska966 contributions\n0\nYummy Vietnamese pancakes, friendly service & clean interior\nSep 2017 • Business\nThe Banh Zeo Cau Mau cafe is located on the edge of large traffic circle close to tho Muongh Thanh Hotel and at the eastern end of the Cau Ninh Kieu bridge ... this place specializes in Vietnamese \"pancakes\" (including the bahn xeo savory filled crepes, plus the small, round bahn khot style ones made from batter and cooked in a special pan, then topped with shrimp or mung beans). The place was clean, bright and cheery, and the staff were very pleasant/polite; our order arrived quickly, and we enjoyed our food along with observing the busy streetside activities. Be sure to come with a group so that you can sample a variety of dishes (as the portions served are large :). Enjoy!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 13, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
