            "review_text": "PAULawan218\nPhilippines107 contributions\n0\nHotspot for banh xeo... however ordered something else\nApr 2017 • Solo\nCafeteria style seating and in open air. Plenty of motorbike parking in the front. Place was empty when I came in but I assume that they (tour guides) bring plenty of business here. Banh Xeo was 80 which is a bit high. Probably because of many tourists come here. Small menu with a decent selection for snacking. Ordered the goi cuon thit snakehead fish and banh Khot Tom. All was good as expected. No issues here. This is not a dinner place by any means.\nRead more\nWritten April 19, 2017",
